<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 737 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 737 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 368 million zlotys of Polish two-year 16-percent bonds and for 369 million zlotys of five-year 12-percent bonds at the treasury's joint 700 million zloty tender, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
